#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.rst:2
msgid "H2 QPE Validation"
msgstr "H2 QPE 验证"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.rst:4
msgid ""
"Compare vacuum and MM-embedded H2 energies. The script reports stabilization in kcal/mol after "
"conversion from Hartree."
msgstr "比较真空与 MM 嵌入的 H2 能量。脚本将 Hartree 转为 kcal/mol 后报告稳定化能。"

