#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.rst:48
msgid "Interpreting Results"
msgstr "解释结果"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.rst:50
msgid ""
"Use the current script's ``run_validation_checks`` and printed results as the integration check. "
"Its example-specific thresholds are ``0.1 kcal/mol`` for PennyLane HF expectation values versus "
"PySCF HF, and ``2.0 Ha`` for absolute QPE–HF differences. These deliberately loose POC checks do "
"not establish chemical accuracy. The script prints failures without setting a failing exit "
"status, so inspect every ``[OK]`` / ``[FAIL]`` line."
msgstr ""
"使用当前脚本的 ``run_validation_checks`` 和打印结果作为集成检查。该示例采用的阈值为：PennyLane HF 期望值与 PySCF HF 相差 ``0.1 "
"kcal/mol``，QPE–HF 绝对差为 ``2.0 Ha``。这些刻意放宽的概念验证检查不能证明化学精度。脚本打印失败时不会设置失败退出状态，因此必须逐行检查 ``[OK]`` / "
"``[FAIL]``。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.rst:57
msgid ""
"The signed offset is ``E_QPE - E_HF``. It includes finite phase resolution, Trotter error, and "
"sampling effects. Do not identify it directly with correlation energy. The default run uses 100 "
"shots, so QPE results can vary. The script defines stabilization as ``(E_vacuum - E_solvated)`` "
"converted to kcal/mol: a positive value means the solvated system has lower energy. The script "
"skips its sign check when the absolute QPE stabilization is at most ``0.01 kcal/mol``."
msgstr ""
"带符号偏差为 ``E_QPE - E_HF``，包含有限相位分辨率、Trotter 误差和采样效应，不能直接视为电子相关能。默认运行使用 100 次采样，因此 QPE "
"结果可能变化。脚本将稳定能定义为 ``(E_vacuum - E_solvated)`` 转换为 kcal/mol 的结果：正值表示溶剂化体系能量更低。当 QPE 稳定能的绝对值至多为 "
"``0.01 kcal/mol`` 时，脚本跳过符号检查。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.rst:65
msgid ""
"To compare regressions, save the output, source revision, dependency versions, device, and QPE "
"parameters. Historical README numbers are not acceptance thresholds."
msgstr "比较回归结果时，保存输出、源码版本、依赖版本、设备和 QPE 参数。历史 README 数值不是验收阈值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.rst:70
msgid "Common Adjustments"
msgstr "常见调整"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-qpe-validation.rst:72
msgid ""
"Use more estimation wires for better phase resolution. Increase Trotter steps only after you "
"check that memory and runtime are acceptable. If the energy appears to wrap or jump by a large "
"amount, inspect the base time and shifted QPE parameters. Do this before you interpret the "
"difference physically."
msgstr "增加估计线路数可提高相位分辨率。仅在确认内存和运行时间可接受后，才增加 Trotter 步数。如果能量看似回绕或大幅跳变，先检查基准时间和平移后的 QPE 参数，再解释差异的物理意义。"
